n story that spans the continent, gathering companions to your Mercenary company, and take on challenges that grow ever greater. Fate has great (and terrible) things in store for you and your companions.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/19ea3ad0884feed2c9ca6716feb177c8.avif?t=1749777691\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/6254ee141fecb104898c63afc888a9b9.poster.avif?t=1749777691\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/6254ee141fecb104898c63afc888a9b9.webm?t=1749777691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/6254ee141fecb104898c63afc888a9b9.mp4?t=1749777691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Missions can have multiple victory conditions, and you only need to meet one to win! When you\u2019re on the back-foot, look for an opportunity to snatch victory from the jaws of defeat.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/953f6e2fb93a8e2bc0819ff8b1698e6c.avif?t=1749777691\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/fe5d03273b8ea5225764a2dcb45ec716.poster.avif?t=1749777691\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/fe5d03273b8ea5225764a2dcb45ec716.webm?t=1749777691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/fe5d03273b8ea5225764a2dcb45ec716.mp4?t=1749777691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Each faction moves one unit at a time. You\u2019ll have to react to the evolving state of the battlefield as you adapt to the changing situations.",
